From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: deepak1556 <hop2deep@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:30:18 +0000
Subject: fix: support native addons with Clang CFI

1) Electron enables CFI-icall in processes that also load independently built
native addons. Route Node addon initializers, Node-API callbacks and cleanup
hooks through narrow unchecked dispatchers, including finalizers invoked after
their environment is gone.

2) Give libuv fs-poll dispatch a distinct name so Electron can exclude that precise
function through its CFI ignorelist instead of changing public callback types.

